<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea's May PPI rises 3.7 pct-government.</title>
<headline>S.Korea's May PPI rises 3.7 pct-government.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's producer price index (PPI) rose 3.7 percent in May on the year, up from a 1.7 percent year-on-year rise a year earlier, Ministry of Finance and Economy figures showed on Friday.</p>
<p>					   May	April     May '96</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, yr-on-yr)	    +3.7     +3.8	+1.7</p>
<p>    PPI (pct, month-to-month)     0.0     -0.4	+0.1</p>
<p>    PPI (base=1990)		 123.7    123.7     119.3</p>
<p>The ministry said the producer price index (PPI) rose 3.5 percent in 1996, against 3.4 percent in 1995.</p>
<p>--Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5645</p>
</text>
